<cap:headline>River Tista at Mekhliganj in Coochbehar district of West Bengal continues to flow in above normal flood situation at 6:00 pm today.</cap:headline>
<cap:description>River Tista at Mekhliganj in Coochbehar district of West Bengal continues to flow in above normal flood situation at 6:00 pm today. At 6:00 pm, it was flowing at a level of 65.78 m with steady trend which is 0.33 m above its Warning Level of 65.45 m and 0.17 m below its Danger Level of 65.95 m.</cap:description>
